Description: Onboarding manager for Ubuntu accounts, YubiKeys, and hardening
 Onboarding is a native GTK 4 application for creating accounts and removing
 standard local accounts,
 enrolling primary and secondary YubiKeys, enforcing password plus YubiKey
 authentication, and independently auditing or applying DevSec OS and SSH
 hardening on Ubuntu 26.04.
